{"seq":3,"slug":"bid-withdraw-rule","title":"出价撤回与有效性规则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/online-auction-marketplace/proxy-bid-anti-snipe/bid-withdraw-rule","wordCount":1979,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"出价撤回与有效性规则\">出价撤回与有效性规则</h1><p>出价一旦落库就不是「一条记录」那么简单——它可能正在驱动代理引擎的当前价、正在被结算任务引用、正在被风控当作证据。撤回一条出价等于给这些下游全体发一次失效通知。更麻烦的是，撤回在机制层面是不被鼓励的：如果撤回无成本，竞买人就能用出价试探对手上限再撤回，把代理出价的保密性彻底废掉。所以撤回规则的设计目标始终是：<strong>让合法误操作可救，让人为试探无利可图</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>法律与平台规则在「能否撤回」上给出的都是「有限允许」的答案，而不是「自由撤回」。UCC §2-328 的表述是：在带保留价与不带保留价的拍卖中，竞买人都可以在成交完成前撤回出价，但撤回不会恢复更早的出价（<a href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/ucc/2/2-328\">Cornell LII, UCC §2-328</a>）。平台侧的普遍做法是加上更严的条件——限时限次、仅限误操作、且撤回记录计入信用。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>严格</th>\n<th>宽松</th>\n<th>工程含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时限</td>\n<td>出价后数分钟内</td>\n<td>落槌前任意时刻</td>\n<td>决定撤回窗口是否是配置项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>限次</td>\n<td>每账号每期有上限</td>\n<td>不限</td>\n<td>决定是否需要计数与配额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>触发条件</td>\n<td>仅误操作（填错价、写错标的）</td>\n<td>任意理由</td>\n<td>决定是否需要申诉流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>曝光</td>\n<td>撤回次数公开可见</td>\n<td>不公开</td>\n<td>决定是否写入公开档案</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[撤回请求] --&gt; B{状态 == running?}&#10;  B --&gt;|否| C[拒绝 已结束]&#10;  B --&gt;|是| D{距出价时刻 &lt; 窗口?}&#10;  D --&gt;|否| E[拒绝 超时]&#10;  D --&gt;|是| F{账号配额未用尽?}&#10;  F --&gt;|否| G[拒绝 超次]&#10;  F --&gt;|是| H{是当前最高出价?}&#10;  H --&gt;|否| I[标记无效 不影响当前价]&#10;  H --&gt;|是| J[重算当前价&lt;br/&gt;由剩余上限推出]&#10;  I --&gt; K[追加撤回事件 触发审计]&#10;  J --&gt; K\">graph TD\n  A[撤回请求] --&gt; B{状态 == running?}\n  B --&gt;|否| C[拒绝 已结束]\n  B --&gt;|是| D{距出价时刻 &lt; 窗口?}\n  D --&gt;|否| E[拒绝 超时]\n  D --&gt;|是| F{账号配额未用尽?}\n  F --&gt;|否| G[拒绝 超次]\n  F --&gt;|是| H{是当前最高出价?}\n  H --&gt;|否| I[标记无效 不影响当前价]\n  H --&gt;|是| J[重算当前价&lt;br/&gt;由剩余上限推出]\n  I --&gt; K[追加撤回事件 触发审计]\n  J --&gt; K</pre><h2 id=\"撤回对当前价的冲击\">撤回对当前价的冲击</h2><h3 id=\"撤回的不是最高价\">撤回的不是最高价</h3><p>若被撤回的出价不是当前最高出价，撤回对展示价零影响，只需把它标记为无效并从「有效出价集合」中移除。此时要重算的是<strong>价格推导链</strong>：如果这条出价曾是次高上限，那么撤回后当前价可能下降一档。</p>\n<h3 id=\"撤回的是最高价\">撤回的是最高价</h3><p>这是真正需要重算的情形。当前价不能简单地「退回上一笔」，因为代理出价的当前价由全部有效上限决定：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>current</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>highest</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> second</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>inc</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{current}=\\min(\\text{highest},\\ \\text{second}+\\text{inc})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">current</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">highest</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">second</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">inc</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。正确做法是丢弃该上限后重新求解，等价于在该拍卖上重放全部有效出价事件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH valid AS (&#10;  SELECT bidder_id, max_amount, created_at&#10;    FROM bid&#10;   WHERE auction_id = :id&#10;     AND kind = &#39;proxy&#39;&#10;     AND withdrawn_at IS NULL&#10;   ORDER BY max_amount DESC, created_at ASC&#10;),&#10;ranked AS (&#10;  SELECT *, row_number() OVER () AS rk FROM valid&#10;)&#10;UPDATE auction a&#10;   SET leader_id     = (SELECT bidder_id  FROM ranked WHERE rk = 1),&#10;       current_price = (SELECT LEAST(&#10;                          (SELECT max_amount FROM ranked WHERE rk = 1),&#10;                          (SELECT max_amount FROM ranked WHERE rk = 2) + :inc))&#10; WHERE a.auction_id = :id&#10;   AND a.status = &#39;running&#39;&#10;   AND a.version = :expected_version;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> valid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bidder_id, max_amount, created_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bid</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> auction_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> kind </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'proxy'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> withdrawn_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> max_amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, created_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ASC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ranked </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">row_number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rk </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> valid</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> auction a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> leader_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bidder_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ranked </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rk </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       current_price </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> LEAST</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                          (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> max_amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ranked </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rk </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                          (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> max_amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ranked </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rk </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :inc))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">auction_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'running'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :expected_version;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>ranked</code> 为空（撤回了最后一条出价）时必须回到「无有效出价」状态：当前价回落到起拍价、领先者为空。这个分支常被漏写，导致撤回后拍卖仍显示一个无人支撑的价格。</p>\n<h3 id=\"撤回与保值纪律\">撤回与保值纪律</h3><p>价格回落是撤回最容易被滥用的地方：与「托儿」账号配合，可以在拍卖末尾制造「价格已冲高」的假象吸引跟风，撤出后再以低价接手。因此撤回事件本身必须触发风控信号，见 <a href=\"../auction-fraud-ops/shill-bid-rig-detect\">托儿、围标与操纵识别</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"有效性的判定层级\">有效性的判定层级</h2><p>「有效出价」在系统里有三层含义，混淆它们是多数诡异 bug 的根源。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三层判定\">三层判定</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>判定依据</th>\n<th>失效后影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>形式有效</td>\n<td>金额 &gt; 0、命中加价阶梯、拍卖在 running</td>\n<td>直接拒绝写入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>机制有效</td>\n<td>未撤回、未被判定欺诈、未被卖家撤拍作废</td>\n<td>从价格推导中排除</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结算有效</td>\n<td>落槌时仍为有效集合中的最高者</td>\n<td>决定赢家与成交价</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一条出价可以「形式有效」但「机制无效」：它成功落库，事后被撤回或被风控作废。这意味着<strong>出价表必须支持软失效</strong>，而不是物理删除——物理删除会让审计断链、让重放失效。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"ALTER TABLE bid&#10;  ADD COLUMN withdrawn_at    TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  ADD COLUMN invalidated_at  TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  ADD COLUMN invalid_reason  TEXT;&#10;&#10;CREATE INDEX bid_effective&#10;  ON bid (auction_id, max_amount DESC, created_at ASC)&#10;  WHERE withdrawn_at IS NULL AND invalidated_at IS NULL;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ALTER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bid</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ADD</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> COLUMN withdrawn_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ADD</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> COLUMN invalidated_at  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ADD</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> COLUMN invalid_reason  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> bid_effective</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bid (auction_id, max_amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, created_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ASC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> withdrawn_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> invalidated_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个<strong>部分索引</strong>是关键工程手段：价格推导只走有效集合，索引本身就把无效出价排除在外，不需要在每个查询里重复写过滤条件，也就不存在「某处忘了过滤」的漏网可能。</p>\n<h3 id=\"严格递增的并列打破\">严格递增的并列打破</h3><p>同价出价必须有一个确定的胜出者，规则是「先提交者优先」，依据是 <code>created_at</code>。但这要求 <code>created_at</code> 在并发下单调：同一拍卖的出价必须由一个单写者或序列化队列分配时间戳，否则两台机器上的 <code>now()</code> 可能倒挂，导致重放结果不稳定。这与代理出价的并列规则是同一件事，见 <a href=\"proxy-bidding-agent\">代理出价（proxy bid）机制</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"撤回的配额与申诉\">撤回的配额与申诉</h2><h3 id=\"配额模型\">配额模型</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;withdrawal_policy&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;window_sec&quot;: 300,&#10;    &quot;quota&quot;: { &quot;per_account_per_quarter&quot;: 5, &quot;per_auction&quot;: 1 },&#10;    &quot;allowed_reasons&quot;: [&quot;wrong_amount&quot;, &quot;wrong_listing&quot;, &quot;seller_changed_terms&quot;, &quot;cannot_contact_seller&quot;],&#10;    &quot;disclosure&quot;: { &quot;public_retraction_count&quot;: true },&#10;    &quot;effects&quot;: { &quot;exclude_from_price_derivation&quot;: true, &quot;triggers_fraud_signal&quot;: true }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"withdrawal_policy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"window_sec\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">300</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"quota\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"per_account_per_quarter\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"per_auction\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"allowed_reasons\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"wrong_amount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"wrong_listing\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"seller_changed_terms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cannot_contact_seller\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"disclosure\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"public_retraction_count\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"effects\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"exclude_from_price_derivation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"triggers_fraud_signal\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>per_auction: 1</code> 这条限制很实用：它允许用户纠正一次填错，但堵死了「出价-撤回-再出价」的循环试探。</p>\n<h3 id=\"与落槌的竞态\">与落槌的竞态</h3><p>撤回请求与落槌判定可能同时到达。裁决必须与买断、延时共享同一把版本锁，保证三者线性化：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"UPDATE bid&#10;   SET withdrawn_at = now()&#10; WHERE bid_id = :bid_id&#10;   AND withdrawn_at IS NULL&#10;   AND EXISTS (&#10;     SELECT 1 FROM auction a&#10;      WHERE a.auction_id = :id&#10;        AND a.status = &#39;running&#39;&#10;        AND a.version = :expected_version&#10;        AND now() - bid.created_at &lt; make_interval(secs =&gt; :window)&#10;   );\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bid</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> withdrawn_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bid_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :bid_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> withdrawn_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> EXISTS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> auction a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">auction_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'running'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :expected_version</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">created_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> make_interval(secs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">window</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">   );</span></span></code></pre></div><p>影响行数为 0 说明拍卖已落槌或已超窗，撤回被拒。这里同样用条件写入而不是先读后写——否则会出现「读到 running、写入时已落槌」的窗口期。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>竞态</th>\n<th>后果</th>\n<th>裁决</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>撤回 vs 落槌</td>\n<td>撤回后仍被判赢家</td>\n<td>版本锁 + 状态谓词</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>撤回 vs 代理抬价</td>\n<td>价格虚高无支撑</td>\n<td>撤回后强制重算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>撤回 vs 撤回</td>\n<td>重复撤回计数</td>\n<td><code>withdrawn_at IS NULL</code> 幂等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>撤回 vs 延时</td>\n<td>开启无限延期</td>\n<td>撤回不触发延时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"撤回后的下游重算\">撤回后的下游重算</h2><p>撤回的影响不会停在这条出价上：代理引擎的当前价要重算，延时的触发历史要保留，结算队列里若已引用这条出价必须重新判定。把这些效果一次说清，才不会出现「撤回生效了、下游还按旧价走」。</p>\n<h3 id=\"需要通知的下游\">需要通知的下游</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>下游</th>\n<th>需要的动作</th>\n<th>幂等依据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>代理引擎</td>\n<td>重解 leader 与当前价</td>\n<td>由有效上限集合唯一确定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反狙击延时</td>\n<td>不触发、不回滚已有延时</td>\n<td>延时是既成事实</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结算队列</td>\n<td>若未执行则重判，已执行则不回退</td>\n<td>判定可重算、结算靠补偿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通知服务</td>\n<td>向被超越者发「已恢复领先」</td>\n<td>事件幂等键</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>风控</td>\n<td>更新账号的撤回计数与信号</td>\n<td>计数即事实</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>延时那一行需要特别说明理由：撤回发生前，那条出价可能已经触发过延时、把结束时间推后了。<strong>已经发生的延时不能因为出价被撤回而回滚</strong>——结束时间只允许单调后移，否则会出现「拍卖已经延期过、又缩回去」这种没人能解释的状态。这条原则与 <a href=\"anti-sniping-time-extend\">反狙击自动延时</a> 中 <code>GREATEST</code> 的单调性要求一致。</p>\n<h3 id=\"重算的边界\">重算的边界</h3><p>重算不是全量重放整场拍卖，而是<strong>由有效上限集合重新求解</strong>。区别在于计算量：一场有两百笔出价的拍卖，重放要处理两百条事件，重解只需读有效集合的前两条（最高与次高上限）。因此实现上应当把「有效上限 Top-2」做成一个可维护的查询，而不是每次撤回都跑一遍完整事件流。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>撤回是「有限允许」：限时、限次、限理由，法律与平台规则都不支持自由撤回。</li>\n<li>撤回非最高出价只需重算推导链；撤回最高出价必须由剩余上限重解，并处理「无有效出价」分支。</li>\n<li>有效性分形式、机制、结算三层；失效必须软删除以保住审计链与重放能力。</li>\n<li>价格推导应走 <code>withdrawn_at IS NULL</code> 的部分索引，把过滤固化进索引避免漏写。</li>\n<li>同价以 <code>created_at</code> 先到者优先，要求时间戳由单写者分配以保证单调。</li>\n<li>撤回不得触发反狙击延时，否则「撤回-重出」会成为无限延期开关。</li>\n<li>撤回与落槌的竞态靠带版本号的状态谓词条件写入化解，与买断裁决共用同一把锁。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"出价撤回与有效性规则","id":"出价撤回与有效性规则"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"撤回对当前价的冲击","id":"撤回对当前价的冲击"},{"level":3,"text":"撤回的不是最高价","id":"撤回的不是最高价"},{"level":3,"text":"撤回的是最高价","id":"撤回的是最高价"},{"level":3,"text":"撤回与保值纪律","id":"撤回与保值纪律"},{"level":2,"text":"有效性的判定层级","id":"有效性的判定层级"},{"level":3,"text":"三层判定","id":"三层判定"},{"level":3,"text":"严格递增的并列打破","id":"严格递增的并列打破"},{"level":2,"text":"撤回的配额与申诉","id":"撤回的配额与申诉"},{"level":3,"text":"配额模型","id":"配额模型"},{"level":3,"text":"与落槌的竞态","id":"与落槌的竞态"},{"level":2,"text":"撤回后的下游重算","id":"撤回后的下游重算"},{"level":3,"text":"需要通知的下游","id":"需要通知的下游"},{"level":3,"text":"重算的边界","id":"重算的边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"反狙击自动延时","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/online-auction-marketplace/proxy-bid-anti-snipe/anti-sniping-time-extend"},"next":{"title":"中标判定与成交结算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/online-auction-marketplace/auction-close-settle/winning-close-settlement"}}